WEBVTT

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:23.710
It's coming!

00:01:25.990 --> 00:01:29.650
Take my special Babe Ruth Swing!

00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:33.070
No way.

00:01:40.810 --> 00:01:41.900
What was that?

00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:43.660
Are we going to die?

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:53.050
Mari-oneechan, where's the transportal?

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:56.420
I can re-cast it.

00:01:57.890 --> 00:01:58.880
Write!

00:01:58.990 --> 00:02:00.790
<b>I am homesick indeed, I am homesick indeed.</b>

00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:03.840
<b>My home, so far, so distant, so remote.</b>

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:11.810
You're wide open from behind!

00:02:24.150 --> 00:02:25.530
Get down, hardhead!

00:02:27.010 --> 00:02:29.790
Kanzaki-kun, what are you doing here?

00:02:30.310 --> 00:02:32.790
Disobeying orders isn't anything new, is it?

00:02:34.060 --> 00:02:36.800
Dammit, what a vice captain.

00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:46.270
Isurugi-senpai and Kanzaki-senpai!

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:52.150
Satsuki!

00:02:57.800 --> 00:03:00.110
Hang in there, Momo-senpai!

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:05.200
I'm not losing to you in speed yet.

00:03:06.510 --> 00:03:07.830
Momo-senpai!

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:15.460
Maya!

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:24.970
Mari-oneechan!

00:03:25.270 --> 00:03:26.780
I need to heal you now!

00:03:26.780 --> 00:03:27.690
No.

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:35.480
You have to continue my 
chant from where I left off.

00:03:35.740 --> 00:03:37.580
It hasn't been done many times,

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:40.370
but it shouldn't be impossible.

00:03:41.510 --> 00:03:42.270
What?

00:03:42.980 --> 00:03:48.260
Maya, you have to open the gate for me.

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:51.500
I can't. I can't do it.

00:03:52.890 --> 00:03:54.000
You can.

00:03:58.020 --> 00:03:59.630
Please.

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:03.390
Mari-oneechan.

00:04:12.610 --> 00:04:14.350
I'll do it, watch me.

00:04:15.740 --> 00:04:17.360
Once again, write!

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:22.530
Momo-senpai!

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:24.770
What are you doing?

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:27.380
But Momo-senpai...

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:33.690
Just draw its attention toward us.

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:35.290
Got it!

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:47.540
<b>I am homesick indeed, I am homesick indeed.</b>

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:51.580
<b>My home, so far, so distant, so remote.</b>

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:53.800
<b>Oh, unreachable land.</b>

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:04.390
Hey, sorry to keep you waiting, little lady.

00:05:04.390 --> 00:05:05.650
Edward-san.

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:09.010
Would you kindly finish the chant?

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:12.410
I want to see the 
jack-in-the-box spring open.

00:05:13.720 --> 00:05:14.940
Okay.

00:05:14.770 --> 00:05:18.410
<b>I am out of reach. I am hateful indeed.</b>

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:21.200
<b>Take my feelings and bind the distance between us.</b>

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:24.160
<b>Take this spell and bend the space between us.</b>

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:26.340
Transportal.

00:05:33.380 --> 00:05:35.080
Moroha-san.

00:05:35.650 --> 00:05:37.190
What happened, Jack?

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:43.880
It's not just any Metaphysical.

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:44.980
What is that thing?

00:05:45.380 --> 00:05:47.360
Don't you think it's strange?

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:49.720
With its firepower,

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:52.970
it should be able to turn this burn 
this entire place down in an instant.

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:56.640
Yet it's as if it's playing with us.

00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:57.730
That can't be.

00:05:57.730 --> 00:05:59.570
It doesn't have that kind of intelligence.

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:02.000
Or it might be waiting.

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:03.340
Waiting?

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:05.300
It's coming again.

00:06:09.070 --> 00:06:10.720
Not you, too, Lesya.

00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:14.400
Come on, this way.

00:06:28.890 --> 00:06:30.160
What was that?

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:36.580
Nii-sama.

00:06:37.610 --> 00:06:39.080
Finally.

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:45.590
How could you?

00:06:46.540 --> 00:06:49.130
The healing magic isn't finished yet.

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:50.800
I don't have time to rest.

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:52.540
Stand up, everyone!

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:54.500
Back up Haimura-kun with everything you've—

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:54.500
Stand back!

00:06:57.130 --> 00:06:59.710
Everyone take the wounded and retreat.

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:03.480
Satsuki, Shizuno, don't you dare come here.

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:05.320
Nii-sama.

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:06.820
Moroha.

00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:11.280
<i>This bastard trampled over all the 
things I cared about in my past life.</i>

00:07:11.790 --> 00:07:13.980
So I'm doing it by myself.

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:15.780
Decree's Weight!

00:07:19.240 --> 00:07:20.340
Write!

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:22.070
<b>There exists purgatory in the netherworld and 
fields of fire in the corporeal world.</b>

00:07:22.230 --> 00:07:26.830
<b>Fire discriminates not against good and evil 
as it burns and purifies with ferocious mercy.</b>

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:28.870
<b>All must die and return to bone.</b>

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:30.540
<b>God has forsaken humanity.</b>

00:07:30.650 --> 00:07:34.330
<b>The world of the decadent is eternal. 
The trumpets must blare and bring the moment of judgment.</b>

00:07:38.170 --> 00:07:41.480
Yin Yang Kurikara!

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:50.530
Magic doesn't work on it!

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:52.150
It dispels everything!

00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:54.810
Then I'll do it just with Plana.

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:01.830
Nii-sama.

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:04.830
Not yet.

00:08:15.150 --> 00:08:16.850
This attack.

00:08:17.130 --> 00:08:18.840
A Fortress-class...

00:08:18.840 --> 00:08:20.350
...sonic attack!

00:08:25.360 --> 00:08:26.360
Whoa.

00:08:27.330 --> 00:08:29.540
That's the UK boss for you!

00:08:29.540 --> 00:08:30.720
Moroha-san.

00:08:30.720 --> 00:08:32.150
At this rate...

00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:37.080
Why you...

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:44.350
Dammit!

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:48.890
Are you telling me that 
that Dragon has the powers

00:08:48.890 --> 00:08:52.130
of all the Metaphysicals that 
Moroha has fought up until now?!

00:08:52.390 --> 00:08:54.940
Urushibara, let's go give Nii-sama support.

00:08:55.290 --> 00:08:56.240
It was waiting.

00:08:56.870 --> 00:08:57.640
Huh?

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:01.120
It was waiting for Moroha to come.

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:03.640
What are you talking about?

00:09:04.050 --> 00:09:06.100
Move! Move!

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:21.920
Stop!

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:26.980
Yes, this is its...

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:38.670
Again.

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:41.260
I couldn't defend them.

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:15.070
What...

00:10:15.770 --> 00:10:17.750
He sounds like a howling monster.

00:10:19.100 --> 00:10:20.630
Jack's transformed.

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:24.060
Pandora's Box.

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:26.180
The box of despair.

00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:30.980
Damn you!

00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:44.870
Die! Die! Die!

00:10:47.950 --> 00:10:48.940
That wound.

00:10:49.360 --> 00:10:50.620
Magic runes.

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:54.270
It's the thirteenth step water magic 
that defeated the Lightning Emperor.

00:10:55.730 --> 00:11:01.920
It can't dispel words carved 
directly on its body.

00:11:01.920 --> 00:11:03.550
But still, it's...

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:06.720
Go to hell!

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:11.850
Stop, Haimura! You'll erase 
this city from the map!

00:11:12.640 --> 00:11:14.630
It's not the usual Moroha

00:11:15.030 --> 00:11:19.650
He's a murderous beast, as I used to be.

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:24.190
What's going on?

00:11:32.760 --> 00:11:37.470
Everything, begone!

00:11:47.820 --> 00:11:49.890
What are you doing there?

00:11:51.050 --> 00:11:52.180
Who are you?

00:11:52.860 --> 00:11:57.200
Do you really want to be sleeping 
when Nii-sama's in trouble?

00:11:57.700 --> 00:12:00.690
But I can't do anything anymore.

00:12:01.590 --> 00:12:02.790
Remember.

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:05.160
Remember?

00:12:08.430 --> 00:12:11.680
The wizard of the netherworld 
going down so easily.

00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:13.430
How laughable.

00:12:15.140 --> 00:12:17.050
Laugh all you want.

00:12:17.440 --> 00:12:20.280
I couldn't do anything for Moroha.

00:12:21.410 --> 00:12:22.670
Remember.

00:12:23.440 --> 00:12:24.810
Remember?

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:30.400
Flaga was always lonely, fighting by himself.

00:12:30.400 --> 00:12:32.700
And you're always just waiting at home.

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:36.920
But that's because Nii-sama 
thinks that's best for me.

00:12:37.340 --> 00:12:42.700
Sure, you're just a cowardly 
girl letting him pamper you.

00:12:43.140 --> 00:12:45.750
No, that's not true.

00:12:45.750 --> 00:12:49.850
I really, really wanted to go with him.

00:12:50.180 --> 00:12:52.710
Then isn't now the time to do that?

00:12:53.190 --> 00:12:53.990
Huh?

00:12:54.880 --> 00:12:58.860
How many times should you see him off?

00:12:59.200 --> 00:13:02.130
I, I...

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:04.470
Now, wake up.

00:13:04.810 --> 00:13:08.470
So that you can walk alongside 
Nii-sama on the same path.

00:13:09.110 --> 00:13:11.030
Have you already forgotten?

00:13:11.030 --> 00:13:14.410
You didn't even have a name 
when you were a slave.

00:13:14.800 --> 00:13:16.710
I wouldn't forget.

00:13:17.460 --> 00:13:19.740
I had no hope for the future.

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:22.580
I lived for the sake of living.

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:23.850
I wouldn't forget that.

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:28.610
Then who was it that removed you from

00:13:28.610 --> 00:13:31.070
your chains and gave you a new life?

00:13:31.070 --> 00:13:34.500
That's Shu Saura, of course.

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:40.280
Then isn't it your turn to 
remove him from his chains?

00:13:41.970 --> 00:13:45.830
A wife is to be by her husband, always.

00:13:48.130 --> 00:13:50.600
I remember.

00:13:51.440 --> 00:13:56.910
Everything, begone!

00:14:29.730 --> 00:14:31.960
Satsuki. Shizuno.

00:14:33.450 --> 00:14:34.560
No.

00:14:35.740 --> 00:14:40.060
That's half correct and half incorrect.

00:14:41.370 --> 00:14:43.020
Remember, Nii-sama,

00:14:43.620 --> 00:14:45.860
we're always together.

00:14:46.640 --> 00:14:49.320
This life, and the next.

00:14:49.870 --> 00:14:52.050
And when we're next reborn.

00:14:53.390 --> 00:14:54.170
Forever.

00:14:54.710 --> 00:14:55.530
Forever.

00:14:56.270 --> 00:14:58.280
I remember.

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:03.530
I'm Kensei Flaga!

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:07.730
And now... Shu Saura, 
king of the netherworld!

00:15:08.940 --> 00:15:10.310
And now,

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:13.530
Haimura Moroha!

00:15:16.740 --> 00:15:18.350
Haimura changed.

00:15:18.880 --> 00:15:23.360
He's embodied his two past 
lives in a single body?

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:28.320
You really pulled out something crazy 
from Pandora's box in the end, Jack!

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:29.860
Yes.

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:30.810
Haimura-han.

00:15:30.810 --> 00:15:31.780
You're so awesome.

00:15:32.850 --> 00:15:35.310
We are the swords of salvation.

00:15:35.730 --> 00:15:37.770
We are the saviors.

00:15:40.030 --> 00:15:43.850
Kamii went around casting healing magic.

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:46.620
Sometimes he's useful.

00:15:47.060 --> 00:15:51.290
A true hero is there when 
you really need him!

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:56.590
We Strikers are going to 
open a path for Haimura-kun!

00:15:56.900 --> 00:15:58.010
Understood.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:06.320
Destroy!

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:10.750
Who's next?

00:16:13.680 --> 00:16:15.030
Take care of the rest!

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:16.330
Moroha!

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:20.580
Guys.

00:16:21.670 --> 00:16:23.620
You're not alone this time.

00:16:24.780 --> 00:16:27.270
Now, let's go, dear.

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:31.590
All right.

00:16:32.030 --> 00:16:32.930
Write!

00:16:33.700 --> 00:16:35.630
<b>There exists purgatory in the netherworld 
and fields of fire in the corporeal world.</b>

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:39.380
<b>Fire discriminates not against good and 
evil as it burns and purifies with ferocious mercy.</b>

00:16:39.490 --> 00:16:40.920
<b>All must die and return to bone.</b>

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:43.010
<b>Be you of this world or of the enlightened.</b>

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:45.590
<b>This body, less hospitable than my home turned to black dirt.</b>

00:16:45.750 --> 00:16:47.600
<b>Endless despair as far as the eye can see.</b>

00:16:50.430 --> 00:16:54.360
Take this sexy adult third step magic.

00:16:55.270 --> 00:16:57.870
Don't fall in love with me!

00:17:00.140 --> 00:17:01.370
No you don't!

00:17:06.680 --> 00:17:08.660
We're here, too!

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:11.630
Support troops from Russia have arrived!

00:17:14.440 --> 00:17:15.880
Go, Brother!

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:18.390
Thanks, everyone.

00:17:19.190 --> 00:17:20.860
Haimura-kun!

00:17:20.860 --> 00:17:22.280
Go!

00:17:22.690 --> 00:17:24.400
We're all rooting for you!

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:28.900
You beat me, you can do it!

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:33.150
Can you hear me, Mari-oneechan?

00:17:34.050 --> 00:17:37.660
Our Moroha-san is back.

00:17:40.260 --> 00:17:41.910
A sonic attack.

00:17:42.600 --> 00:17:44.480
Ginrei Argusten!

00:17:47.360 --> 00:17:51.010
You've grown up, little girl.

00:17:51.010 --> 00:17:51.670
Ed-sama.

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:52.800
Oh, whoops.

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:55.690
Now, Jack, it's your turn!

00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:58.400
Yeah, I know.

00:18:10.260 --> 00:18:11.190
Nii-sama.

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:12.150
Dear.

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:33.800
I won't forgive anyone that steals from us!

00:18:40.660 --> 00:18:42.970
Yin Yang Vlitora!

00:19:00.580 --> 00:19:02.640
He did it!

00:19:02.640 --> 00:19:03.620
Tanaka, Yeah.

00:19:17.730 --> 00:19:18.920
Branch Chief.

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:22.730
He defeated it, huh?

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:34.480
Man, it's been a while since I've 
been in Japan. It was fun, Jack.

00:19:34.890 --> 00:19:37.990
Come on, stop calling me Jack.

00:19:38.700 --> 00:19:40.120
It's almost time.

00:19:40.510 --> 00:19:44.690
Angela-san, you can text 
me whenever you get lonely.

00:19:44.690 --> 00:19:45.980
Who would ever?

00:19:46.430 --> 00:19:48.000
Oh, by the way...

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:53.020
Beware of the France branch chief, Charles.

00:19:53.020 --> 00:19:53.960
Huh?

00:19:54.600 --> 00:19:55.650
See you.

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:10.700
I'll go find my chauffeur, Tatemura-san.

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:13.240
Hey, Satsuki,

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:17.910
Do you really not remember about 
when we defeated the Dragon?

00:20:19.600 --> 00:20:20.830
Oh, yeah.

00:20:20.830 --> 00:20:22.350
I had something like a dream.

00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:23.490
A dream?

00:20:24.930 --> 00:20:26.640
The same dream I always have.

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:30.540
From when I was Sarasha and you were Flaga.

00:20:34.970 --> 00:20:40.010
Anyway, now that we're 
alone together for once...

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:41.270
Okay?

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:46.060
Oh, look.

00:20:46.840 --> 00:20:48.890
A washed-up octopus.

00:20:48.890 --> 00:20:50.540
Who are you calling an octopus?

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:52.720
It's boiled red.

00:21:00.840 --> 00:21:04.020
We had so many memories together in there.

00:21:04.020 --> 00:21:06.460
We can make more memories.

00:21:06.960 --> 00:21:08.560
Yeah.

00:21:08.560 --> 00:21:12.590
We can make lots of memories, 
just the two of us.

00:21:13.680 --> 00:21:15.090
Oh, that's too bad.

00:21:16.110 --> 00:21:19.470
Moroha is going to be living 
at my place for a while.

00:21:21.320 --> 00:21:23.060
Let's see, for you, Ranjou-san,

00:21:23.060 --> 00:21:26.000
I could offer the kennel that 
used to belong to my John.

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:27.840
I'm a dog?!

00:21:27.840 --> 00:21:29.660
No, John's a cat.

00:21:29.660 --> 00:21:31.260
That's so confusing!

00:21:31.260 --> 00:21:32.890
There, there, you two.

00:21:36.950 --> 00:21:41.020
Nii-sama, hurry up, I'll leave you behind.

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:45.610
Why is she so hyper?

00:21:45.970 --> 00:21:48.390
She's like a dirty little puppy.

00:21:48.390 --> 00:21:51.090
You didn't have to say "dirty."

00:21:53.540 --> 00:21:54.390
Hey...

00:21:54.820 --> 00:21:55.980
What is it?

00:21:56.650 --> 00:21:59.650
When I almost lost control of my powers,

00:22:00.200 --> 00:22:01.750
I met the witch of the netherworld.

00:22:04.820 --> 00:22:06.660
Was that your—

00:22:08.260 --> 00:22:11.110
That's our secret.

00:22:13.550 --> 00:22:16.190
Hey!

00:22:16.190 --> 00:22:18.810
Urushibara!

00:22:39.140 --> 00:22:41.430
Welcome home, Master.

00:22:43.470 --> 00:22:44.600
What now?

00:22:46.690 --> 00:22:49.680
I learned that this is how 
greetings are done in Japan.

00:22:50.690 --> 00:22:52.180
Greetings?

00:22:52.580 --> 00:22:55.930
A party, of course!

00:22:56.200 --> 00:22:58.740
Where were you? You're late!

00:22:59.280 --> 00:23:00.610
We were waiting for you!

00:23:01.430 --> 00:23:03.490
Let's make some noise!

00:23:03.490 --> 00:23:05.550
Ochen horosho.

00:23:06.230 --> 00:23:08.300
You guys are still here, Katya?

00:23:09.910 --> 00:23:12.190
Thank you, everyone.

00:23:12.190 --> 00:23:14.350
The academy is safe, too.

00:23:15.400 --> 00:23:19.020
But it's a shame most of it is demolished.

00:23:20.790 --> 00:23:21.960
No,

00:23:22.470 --> 00:23:25.680
as long as the students are 
all safe, it doesn't matter.

00:23:26.740 --> 00:23:27.510
Right.

00:23:28.650 --> 00:23:30.590
Now, today, we're going to hold

00:23:30.590 --> 00:23:33.470
Haimura-kun's belated welcome 
home celebration, and...

00:23:33.900 --> 00:23:36.690
Drunken orgy!

00:23:36.690 --> 00:23:38.480
Yeah!

00:23:38.950 --> 00:23:40.480
Nii-sama!

00:23:41.060 --> 00:23:41.980
Moroha.

00:23:42.370 --> 00:23:44.480
Brother!

00:23:45.380 --> 00:23:46.950
First prize!

00:23:50.440 --> 00:23:56.030
<i>I surely will not forget about this day.</i>

00:23:56.870 --> 00:24:02.920
<i>The day Moroha-san came home, 
and everyone had glowing smiles.</i>

00:24:04.070 --> 00:24:08.430
<i>No matter how many times I'm reborn.</i>
